    {%- capture default_replo_text_b083fe2c-eaec-491d-a308-ec483df93e5f -%}<p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign replo_text_b083fe2c-eaec-491d-a308-ec483df93e5f = replo_text_b083fe2c-eaec-491d-a308-ec483df93e5f | default: default_replo_text_b083fe2c-eaec-491d-a308-ec483df93e5f -%}
