    {%- capture default_replo_text_831a5ddc-68eb-4cb1-a6f4-44e9e54870b7 -%}<p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign replo_text_831a5ddc-68eb-4cb1-a6f4-44e9e54870b7 = replo_text_831a5ddc-68eb-4cb1-a6f4-44e9e54870b7 | default: default_replo_text_831a5ddc-68eb-4cb1-a6f4-44e9e54870b7 -%}
