    {%- capture default_replo_text_571a30df-4b56-4ef8-b906-dce0d31b071f -%}<p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
